think A teaching turn under the standing help-me-learn word: DirtySet is the record of which surface regions changed since the last frame -- the standard dirty-region idea (AppKit setNeedsDisplay, Wayland damage) -- shaped here by the nine-node snapshot: seat 0 whole-surface, seats 1-8 the 3x3 tiles, a nine-bit mask with idempotent marks, typed range refusal, and Surf/Skate aliases.
